# Root .dockerignore for the monolith build (Dockerfile builds from repo root).
# Without this, backend/.venv and frontend/node_modules alone were pushing the build
# context past 1GB. Neither belongs in the image: the frontend-builder stage installs
# its own node_modules, and the final stage's `uv sync` builds its own .venv.
.git
**/.venv
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/dist
**/build
frontend/.vercel
